SERVICES

Software service for licenses will align with the three system classes.
Service rights to new version offerings (LPS or SUSL) will be based on a
consistent percentage of the license price.

ClusterWide service will continue to be offered for those users who have
ClusterWide contracts. Users with service based on the Traditional License
tiers will migrate to service based on the system class structure at
contract renewal.

