	     Gateway on OpenVMS VAX

TECHNICAL DATA

Prerequisites

o  MAILbus 400 XMR Gateway operates on OpenVMS VAX V5-5.2 and later
o  Access to MAILbus 400 MTA and DEC X.500 DSA is required.
o  The CDA libraries must be installed with MAILbus 400 MTA on OpenVMS VAX.


