HIGHLIGHTS

o  V1.1 provides Forte Objectbroker bidirectional support

o  Supports OpenVMS V6.1 and DEC OSF/1 V3.0 systems

o  Course offerings for system managers, application developers, and
   applications designers

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The Forte advanced development environment simplifies and speeds the process
of creating mission-critical client/server applications. Forte helps
software professionals develop, deploy, and manage these applications, and
realize productivity gains throughout the application life cycle.

Applications developed with Forte are independent of the underlying
computing environment, including hardware architectures, operating systems,
networks, GUIs, and databases. Forte is integrated with other Digital
leadership products for open client/server computing. Forte runs on OpenVMS
VAX and AXP, DEC OSF/1, HP, IBM, Sun, DG, and Sequent UNIX platforms, as
well as on PCs and Macintosh systems.

V1.1 (SPD #53.25) provides Objectbroker bidirectional support, extending the
development capabilities of Forte beyond new business critical applications
to legacy applications, taking advantage of ObjectBroker encapsulation.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

