PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

PATHWORKS Remote V5.1 for DOS and Windows (SPD 45.68.xx) combines all the
major wide area network connectivity solutions available today into one
product. With PATHWORKS Remote software, users can connect a remote PC to
any PATHWORKS server (OpenVMS, DEC OSF/1, OS/2, SCO UNIX, and Windows NT
systems) or any LAN Manager based file and print services over the PSDN,
ISDN (Integrated Services Digital Network), or X.25 Packet Switched Data
Network (PSDN). All PATHWORKS for DOS and Windows (SPD 55.07.xx)
