o  Users have a choice of outgoing and incoming calls (ISDN, X.25), which
   allow applications either on the central or on the isolated site to
   establish the connection.

o  Supports all applications and services that use TCP/IP and DECnet
   protocols, including file and print, terminal emulation, mail, X Windows,
   and 3270.

